# NOTE: this file is INERT and kept only as a pointer.
#
# Stow reads .stow-local-ignore from inside a *package* directory, where it filters files
# within that package. This copy sits in the stow directory (the repo root), which is not
# a package, so Stow never consults it — it does NOT exclude anything from `stow */`.
#
# The real exclusions live where Stow actually looks:
#   docs/.stow-local-ignore          — documentation, not a package
#   zettelkasten/.stow-local-ignore  — schema is copied into the vault, not symlinked
#   vscode/.stow-local-ignore        — managed via vscode/install.sh
# and bootstrap.sh skips the same three by name.
#
# Patterns below are left for documentation only.
^vscode$
^zettelkasten$
^docs$
